  m_text: 'This town, it was once your home. But you can''t put your trust in these
    people any longer.


    No... they wish to stop you on your quest for revenge.
    They want to slay you and take your second chance from your grasp.


    Do not
    let them stop you. Cut down those who would stand in your way. Do not fight the
    hunger.


    Just a little further. You can see the church in the distance...'
