  m_text: 'You''ve made it. Up ahead, you can faintly make out the figure of a wizard.


    The
    overwhelming power oozing from him is proof enough that you''ve found your target.


    There''s
    no time to act idly when your goal is right there.


    Feed your hunger. Get
    your revenge.


    Finish it.'
